Package: DIAgui
Version: 1.4.9
Type: Package
Title: DIAgui with Robust Summarization support
Author: Marc-Antoine GERAULT
Maintainer: Marc-Antoine GERAULT <marco.gerault@gmail.com>
Description: Fork of DIAgui with added Robust Summarization method using
             MsCoreUtils. Provides an alternative to MaxLFQ for protein 
             quantification that is more resistant to outliers. Based on 
             the robust summarization approach used in msqrob2.
